* The Moebius sum over the common divisors of ` K ` and ` N ` is ` [ gcd ( K , N ) = 1 ] ` ( ~ bvmusum at the gcd, ~ sumss2 , ~ dvdsgcdb ).

s1::simpl |- ( ( N e. NN /\ K e. NN ) -> N e. NN )
s2::simpr |- ( ( N e. NN /\ K e. NN ) -> K e. NN )
